text: |-
  2:384
  <
  +1 (202)
  Yesterday
  Do you think I didn't notice you
  handed your text messages about
  Candace over to Veritas? You're
  being far too brazen. I know you're
  without a lawyer, how on earth do
  you think pulling a stunt like that
  helps you? You'd better remember
  every single day that you're only alive
  because of me, and that you were
  never extradited because of me as
  well. The next time I see any of your
  messages leaked to Veritas, things
  are going to change. Barr is already
  running out of patience with your
  behavior.
  Be careful,
  1:39 PM
  Candace paying for your security
  these days? Because if she isn't, she
  really ought to be. And now that
  you're on her team and act like the
  two of you are thick as thieves, you
  can pass along a message for me:
  things won't end well for either of you
  if this nonsense keeps up. Just take a
  good, hard look at what happened
  with Kirk, and maybe you'll think
  twice.
  1:44PM
